OL,3,GNEWSADid a woman's brutal death
OL,4,Ainfluence Guy Fawkes?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe "brutal" execution of a Catholic
OL,7,Fmartyr in York may have helped shape
OL,8,Fthe religious fervour of Guy Fawkes, a
OL,9,Fhistorian has claimed.
OL,11,FMargaret Clitherow was crushed to death
OL,12,Fin 1586 after refusing to enter a plea
OL,13,Fto charges she had harboured Catholic
OL,14,Fpriests, a serious offence in
OL,15,FElizabethan England.
OL,17,FAlmost two decades later, Fawkes and
OL,18,Fhis co-conspirators would be caught
OL,19,Fattempting to blow up Parliament and
OL,20,Fdestroy England's political elite
OL,21,Fincluding King James VI and I.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
