OL,3,GNEWSADid a woman's brutal death
OL,4,Ainfluence Guy Fawkes?
OL,5,
OL,6,FDr Hannah Thomas, from York's Bar
OL,7,FConvent museum, said a young Fawkes and
OL,8,Ffellow conspirators may have witnessed
OL,9,FClitherow's death.
